caption:
This pav bhaji was lit😍 and guess what it had no onions & garlic😨😨 This pure vegetarian restaurant @vega.pure.vegetarian is serving some really dope food that even non-veg people would prefer visiting this restro over any other😍

Each dish is made with perfection and I, myself find food without onion & garlic to be bland but at this restro I was amazed with the flavours that I couldn't recognize the whole meal had no onions or garlic.

