caption:
This kid is the true Inspiration for young generation as he is done with the school, he go the the market and buy this murmura from shop and add his own secret masala tossed with lemon juice and sell it on the lake, he is being a true Business man by making profit out of this for his funding on his school and books, he was an amazing soul to intract with, his speech was soo strong and bold that it inspired me to a different level.
.
Picture and caption by : @smile__and__click .
.
.
